WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.980
The Rose of Versailles

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.980
The Rose of Versailles

00:00:07.020 --> 00:00:10.250
<i>July 12, 1789, morning.</i>

00:00:10.250 --> 00:00:13.770
<i>Yesterday, Jacques Necker, the Minister
of Finance was dismissed from his post.</i>

00:00:13.770 --> 00:00:18.660
<i>Later, a false rumor spread about a coming massacre
of patriots, causing people to take up arms.</i>

00:00:18.660 --> 00:00:21.720
<i>There is no distinction between
day and night in Paris now.</i>

00:00:21.720 --> 00:00:25.500
<i>People are running around in the back
alleyways, wielding clubs and knives.</i>

00:00:26.430 --> 00:00:29.260
<i>The 100,000 strong army that
has been gathered in Paris,</i>

00:00:29.260 --> 00:00:31.030
<i>burn bonfires and berate its citizens.</i>

00:00:31.030 --> 00:00:33.140
<i>Confusion and suspicion...</i>

00:00:33.140 --> 00:00:35.940
<i>Is this the early heartbeat of the new era?</i>

00:00:35.940 --> 00:00:38.390
<i>Could it mean something
for a brighter tomorrow?</i>

00:00:38.810 --> 00:00:40.170
<i>I don't know.</i>

00:00:40.170 --> 00:00:41.860
<i>I don't know, but I'll watch...</i>

00:00:41.860 --> 00:00:44.060
<i>...the final moments of this era...</i>

00:00:44.060 --> 00:00:45.750
<i>...with my right eye.</i>

00:00:45.750 --> 00:00:48.980
<i>My right eye, which has
become almost blind...</i>

